This is Arisa!

00:23:07.880 --> 00:23:08.980
This is Ritsuo Syoujin.

00:23:08.980 --> 00:23:10.190
Hel... you're giving your full name?

00:23:10.510 --> 00:23:12.650
All right, one more time! This is Arisa Glennorth!

00:23:12.680 --> 00:23:13.630
This is Syoujin.

00:23:14.300 --> 00:23:16.530
By the way, sempai, it's the Genesis Mission, isn't it?

00:23:16.550 --> 00:23:19.360
Mm. 
 We have to have to evacuate, but...

00:23:19.430 --> 00:23:19.740
Mm.

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:22.480
Shipon is taking part, right? Along with all of you in the Big Four.

00:23:22.570 --> 00:23:22.990
Mm.

00:23:23.060 --> 00:23:24.530
I wonder if Shipon's going to be all right.

00:23:24.600 --> 00:23:25.160
Mm.

00:23:25.230 --> 00:23:26.890
For some reason, I've started to worry about her.

00:23:26.970 --> 00:23:27.560
Mm.

00:23:27.770 --> 00:23:29.300
On the next episode of Stellvia of the Universe...

00:23:29.530 --> 00:23:30.600
"That's Why You're There."

00:23:30.950 --> 00:23:31.380
Mm.

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:33.720
Mm? Don't sleep!

00:23:32.050 --> 00:23:35.050
Episode twenty-three 
That's Why You're There
